---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Resources for YouTube Creators"
description: "Free creator resources from Creator Essentials — blog posts, YouTube terms glossary, free guides, and tools to help you grow your channel."
permalink: /resources/
sitemap_priority: 0.8
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--red)">Resources</span>
    <h1>Resources for YouTube Creators</h1>
    <p>Creator Essentials provides creators with a variety of valuable resources for their video creator journey — from actionable blog content and free guides to a full YouTube terms glossary.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));">

      <a href="/blog/" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;">
        <div class="card card-red" style="height:100%;">
          <h3>Blog</h3>
          <p>Insights specifically for video creators. Strategy, SEO, coaching, tools, thumbnails — practical content for serious YouTubers.</p>
          <span class="card-cta">Read the Blog
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M3 7h8M7 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/glossary/" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;">
        <div class="card" style="height:100%;">
          <h3>YouTube Terms Glossary</h3>
          <p>Not sure what a term or phrase means? Check out this glossary specifically for video creators — 60+ definitions covering algorithm, CTR, retention, SEO, and more.</p>
          <span class="card-cta">Browse the Glossary
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M3 7h8M7 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/resources/free-guides/" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;">
        <div class="card" style="height:100%;">
          <h3>Free Guides</h3>
          <p>These free one-stop-shop guides are designed to help you launch and put your YouTube channel and brand on the map.</p>
          <span class="card-cta">Get Free Guides
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M3 7h8M7 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-cloud">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Recent from the Blog</span>
      <h2>Fresh creator strategy content</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      {% for post in collections.posts | slice(0, 3) %}
      <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="post-card" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;">
        <div class="post-card-meta">
          <time datetime="{{ post.date | dateISO }}">{{ post.date | dateDisplay }}</time>
        </div>
        <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        <span class="card-cta">Read more
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M3 7h8M7 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:2rem;">
      <a href="/blog/" class="btn btn-secondary">View All Articles</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-charcoal cta-banner">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Find the tools to back up the strategy</h2>
    <p>Curated equipment and software picks that serious YouTubers actually use.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="/tools/" class="btn btn-white">View YouTuber Tools</a>
      <a href="https://www.heathincometax.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline-white">Get Tax Help</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
